{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-f13ea0db41d8","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-f13ea0db41d8","name":"烤鸡翅","category":"meat_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/meat_dish/%E7%83%A4%E9%B8%A1%E7%BF%85.md","blob_sha":"54c23da5aa319fc340e46efd6f7273d945225985","details":{"introduction":"腌制入味的鸡中翅经高温烘烤，外皮微焦、内里鲜嫩多汁，带有黑胡椒和酱油的咸香。富含优质蛋白质和胶原蛋白。难度适中，新手也能轻松上手，从准备到出炉大约需要 1 小时。还可按喜好添加蜂蜜或五香粉增添风味。","difficulty":"★★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 鸡翅中\n- 盐\n- 黑胡椒粉\n- 酱油\n- 料酒\n- 烤箱"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 鸡翅用量为 3-4 个/人\n- 盐的用量为 2 g/人\n- 黑胡椒粉的用量为 1 g/人\n- 酱油的用量为 3 ml/人\n- 料酒的用量为 3 ml/人\n\n使用上述条件，计算出计划使用的原材料比例。"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"### 鸡翅的预处理\n\n1. 鸡翅放入碗中\n2. 加盐、黑胡椒粉、酱油、料酒进行腌制 30-40 分钟\n\n### 烤制过程\n\n1. 将烤箱预热至 200℃\n2. 将腌制好的鸡翅均匀地放在烤盘上\n3. 将烤盘放入烤箱中层，烤 15-20 分钟\n4. 取出烤盘，将鸡翅翻面，再烤 15-20 分钟，直到熟透"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 可以在腌制鸡翅时加入蜂蜜、酱油、姜蒜粉、五香粉等作为调味料，提升口感和香气\n- 烤鸡翅时，建议将烤盘底部垫上一层锡纸，便于清洁烤盘"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：鸡翅肉和皮（去骨）400g、通用酱油（shoyu近似）20g、白砂糖10g、大豆食用油10g、黑胡椒粉2g、食盐3g、去皮大蒜10g；整份约350g。去骨鸡翅净肉带皮，不使用品牌腌料或料酒；烤盘汁液全部食用。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":263.32,"protein_g":20.706286,"carbohydrate_g":4.450286,"fat_g":17.5512},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172390/nutrients","version":"43c9c65846a7ae06","fdc_ids":[172390,174277,169655,171411,170931,173468,169230]},"profile_id":"family-f13ea0db41d8-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-f13ea0db41d8","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-f13ea0db41d8","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"bake","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":true,"brand":null,"variant":"family-f13ea0db41d8-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"chicken_wing","grams":400},{"key":"soy","grams":20},{"key":"sugar","grams":10},{"key":"oil","grams":10},{"key":"black_pepper","grams":2},{"key":"salt","grams":3},{"key":"garlic","grams":10}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"43c9c65846a7ae06","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-f13ea0db41d8-v1.20cc40aca20ccff1.json","bytes":31607,"sha256":"20cc40aca20ccff13109348298ee4de93ba915826906c59eddefe4d327a496b1"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-f13ea0db41d8-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-f13ea0db41d8","recipe_blob_sha":"54c23da5aa319fc340e46efd6f7273d945225985","version":"1","data_version":"43c9c65846a7ae06","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":350,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品350g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：鸡翅肉和皮（去骨）400g、通用酱油（shoyu近似）20g、白砂糖10g、大豆食用油10g、黑胡椒粉2g、食盐3g、去皮大蒜10g；整份约350g。去骨鸡翅净肉带皮，不使用品牌腌料或料酒；烤盘汁液全部食用。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-f13ea0db41d8","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"bake","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":true,"brand":null,"variant":"family-f13ea0db41d8-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"chicken_wing","grams":400},{"key":"soy","grams":20},{"key":"sugar","grams":10},{"key":"oil","grams":10},{"key":"black_pepper","grams":2},{"key":"salt","grams":3},{"key":"garlic","grams":10}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的